  "contents": [
    {
      "audioPlayer": {
        "sticky": true,
        "src": "/assets/audio/specific-purposes/business/sbelaa/lesson-20.mp3"
      }
    },
    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 20 • Talking About a Brown Noser",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Nearly every office has one: the brown noser. He or she will do just about anything to win favor with the boss. Here Tony, Karen, and Nancy complain about their local brown noser, Mitch."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Tony: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I was just in a meeting with Mitch and Bill. Mitch said to Bill, “Bill, we’re so lucky to have you as our boss. You’re such a great leader!”"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Karen: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "He’s "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "up to his old tricks"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". He’s up to his old tricks. He was trying to earn "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "brownie points"
                },
                {
                  "text": " with Bill."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nancy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Mitch has the reputation of being a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "yes man"
                },
                {
                  "text": " and a brown noser. He’s an expert at kissing up."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Mitch has the reputation of being a yes man and a brown noser. He’s an expert at "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "kissing up"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Tony: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Then he said to Bill, “Other people here don’t appreciate you like I do!” "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Talk about"
                },
                {
                  "text": " trying to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "butter up"
                },
                {
                  "text": " the boss!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nancy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Yeah, and this time "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "at our expense"
                },
                {
                  "text": "! He’s just "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "out for himself"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Karen: "
                },
                {
                  "text": " Well, it’s a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "dog-eat-dog world"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Obviously he thinks this is the way to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "get ahead"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Tony: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I guess it’s one way to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "climb the corporate ladder"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". But I could never "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "look at myself in the mirror"
                },
                {
                  "text": " after behaving that way."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Karen: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I’m not good at "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "kissing up"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "No wonder"
                },
                {
                  "text": " I’ve been in the same lousy position for 10 years!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Talking About a Brown Noser, Part 2: When You’re Overheard"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mitch: "
                },
                {
                  "text": " Hey guys. Don’t you know it’s rude to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "talk behind someone’s back"
                },
                {
                  "text": "? I just overheard your entire conversation!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Tony: "
                },
                {
                  "text": " Sorry, Mitch. We didn’t mean to offend you."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mitch: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "the walls have ears"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Think twice"
                },
                {
                  "text": " before you insult me again!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Nancy: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Chill out"
                },
                {
                  "text": "! We were talking about a different Mitch, not you."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Tony: "
                },
                {
                  "text": " That’s right. We were talking about Mitch Schneider, over in the accounting department."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          ,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mitch: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": " Likely story"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "I wasn’t born yesterday"
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
